She built subscription apps and she built health apps and our business model has started working really well and it was difficult to imagine that apps would become like businesses with hundreds of millions in revenue several years back and next year Flo will earn close to three hundred million if we are successful and it's the biggest health app in the world with 73 million months selective users and in the United States 25 percent of all women younger than 45 hour month selective users.

